<title>UK: Bradford wool tends just easier.</title>
<headline>Bradford wool tends just easier.</headline>
<dateline>BRADFORD 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>A firmer Sydney wool opening and a drop in sterling against the Australian dollar were not followed through in appreciable gains here and some wools were a fraction easier at closing sales on Thursday.</p>
<p>Potential buyers were tempted to look for some further easing to come, whilst holidays depressed Bradford and Italian activity.</p>
</text>
